WEBVTT

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:04.380
Episode 8

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:04.380
Desperate Yamato<i>!!
</i>Destroy the Reflective Satellite Cannon<i>!!</i>

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:04.380
( Air date: Nov 24, 1974 )

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:27.600
Saraba Chikyuu yo

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:31.400
Tabidatsu fune wa...

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:40.550
...uchuu senkan Yamato

00:00:35.710 --> 00:00:40.170
Space Battleship

00:00:35.710 --> 00:00:40.170
<i>YAMATO</i>

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:44.000
Uchuu no kanata Iscandar he...

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.210
...unmei seoi...

00:00:45.510 --> 00:00:48.410
...ima tobitatsu

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:51.520
Kanarazu koko he...

00:00:51.790 --> 00:00:54.800
...kaette kuru to

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:58.330
Te wo furu hito ni...

00:00:58.590 --> 00:01:03.600
...egao de kotae

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:05.700
Ginga wo hanare...

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.200
...Iscandar he...

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:10.400
...harubaru nozomu

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:17.100
Uchuu senkan Yamato

00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:38.170
In 2199, Earth was attacked by
the mysterious planet, Gamilus...

00:01:34.540 --> 00:01:39.140
Pluto

00:01:38.170 --> 00:01:44.010
{YUUSEI}...and mankind is facing extinction in one
year due to the radioactive meteor bombs.

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:48.240
{CHIKYU}The space battleship Yamato, the first
Earth ship to exceed the speed of light...

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:50.390
{housyanou}...has left on a round
trip of 296,000 light years...

00:01:50.390 --> 00:01:56.200
{housyanou}...to the planet Iscandar to
obtain the radioactive purifier.

00:01:56.200 --> 00:02:01.040
{SONO}The Gamilus frontline base on Pluto
was prepared for the Yamato.

00:02:06.090 --> 00:02:08.860
{YAMATO}The Yamato has sunk
into the ocean on Pluto.

00:02:08.860 --> 00:02:12.620
{DAGA}But the space battleship
Yamato is not yet dead.

00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:19.970
Depth is 300 meters.

00:02:21.130 --> 00:02:24.220
Captain, is the
Yamato going to sink ?

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:27.570
Rotate the ship, and we'll
command from the third bridge.

00:02:27.570 --> 00:02:29.800
We'll play dead.
Got that ?

00:02:31.390 --> 00:02:33.210
Blow the starboard tank.

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:35.040
Blowing starboard tank.

00:03:02.390 --> 00:03:03.840
Gantz, look.

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:05.970
Congratulations,
Commander Shultz.

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:10.970
I wish I could show my
superb ability to Lord Desler.

00:03:10.970 --> 00:03:13.800
Send in the subs
to finish it.

00:03:13.800 --> 00:03:14.850
Aye, sir.

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:31.590
Bottom Third Bridge

00:03:33.140 --> 00:03:36.240
Captain, unknown objects
are approaching.

00:03:36.240 --> 00:03:38.280
Submarines or torpedoes ?

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:39.770
Most likely submarines.

00:03:40.140 --> 00:03:42.140
Captain, I can't
stand this anymore.

00:03:42.140 --> 00:03:45.970
Let me form a special assault
team and attack the enemy base.

00:03:45.970 --> 00:03:47.710
Alright, form the assault unit.

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:48.350
Aye, sir.

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:50.740
Nanbu.

00:03:50.740 --> 00:03:51.260
Right.

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:55.780
Summon Analyzer, Kato, Nemoto
and Sugiyama to the Explorer.

00:03:55.780 --> 00:03:58.970
Kodai, this is the
analysis of Pluto.

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:02.300
Arigato.
Come on, Nanbu.

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:05.040
Chief Engineer Sanada,
how's the repair work going ?

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:08.860
At this rate, it'll
take eight more hours.

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:13.050
You'll join Kodai and carry out an
operation to destroy the enemy base.

00:04:13.050 --> 00:04:13.930
Aye, sir.

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:16.490
Kodai, is the Explorer ready ?

00:04:16.490 --> 00:04:17.680
Ready, sir.

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:20.130
Flood the Explorer dock.

00:04:20.130 --> 00:04:22.180
Aye. Flooding the dock.

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:34.560
Launch the Explorer.

00:04:44.920 --> 00:04:48.720
Gamilus submarines identified.
Approaching rapidly.

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:50.830
Distance, 40 km.

00:04:52.010 --> 00:04:53.540
Prepare to fire missiles.

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:54.620
Preparing to fire missiles.

00:04:57.410 --> 00:04:59.780
Alright.
We'll normalize the ship.

00:04:59.780 --> 00:05:00.620
Prepare to normalize.

00:05:01.430 --> 00:05:03.050
Blow the port ballast tank.

00:05:03.470 --> 00:05:05.030
Blow the main tank.

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:07.720
Starboard pressurization, activated.

00:05:13.480 --> 00:05:15.530
Gyro is in
normal position.

00:05:15.530 --> 00:05:16.470
Rotate full.

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:03.070
The Yamato is alive...?!

00:06:03.070 --> 00:06:07.770
I've already told Lord Desler...
What's gonna happen to me ?

00:06:09.100 --> 00:06:11.390
Damn, destroy it !
Destroy it !

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:14.470
Destroy it no matter what,
or I'll be executed.

00:06:18.300 --> 00:06:20.080
Air generator is damaged.

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:21.350
Say what ?

00:06:21.350 --> 00:06:25.110
We're in trouble.
We can't stay submerged very long.

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:27.720
Aihara, contact Kodai, and tell him...

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:33.740
..."Complete your operation
in 8 hours, or we'll..."

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:49.990
The Yamato's sensors couldn't find it, so that
laser cannon wasn't exposed on the surface.

00:06:49.990 --> 00:06:51.150
I got it.

00:06:51.900 --> 00:06:55.920
Chief Engineer, the Yamato's
air generator was damaged.

00:06:55.920 --> 00:07:02.350
If we can't destroy the enemy's laser cannon,
it'll have to make a suicidal attack.

00:07:02.350 --> 00:07:05.120
Oh, no !  Chief Engineer
Sanada, what should we do ?

00:07:07.770 --> 00:07:12.500
In order to fire that cannon, there has to
be an exhaust port. If we can find it...

00:07:18.640 --> 00:07:22.740
Captain, incoming message
from Chief Engineer Sanada.

00:07:22.740 --> 00:07:26.620
"We're searching for the exhaust port,
but we have no idea where to look."

00:07:28.860 --> 00:07:30.730
Alright, surface the Yamato.

00:07:30.730 --> 00:07:31.900
Captain ?!

00:07:31.900 --> 00:07:34.740
Surface, and let them
fire the laser cannon.

00:07:34.740 --> 00:07:38.710
Captain, are you sure ?
If that laser hits the Yamato again...

00:07:38.710 --> 00:07:40.210
Don't worry.

00:07:40.210 --> 00:07:43.220
Pay attention to the opening of
those reflector plates in space.

00:07:43.220 --> 00:07:47.170
There's a slight time gap between the
operation of the reflector and the actual shot.

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:10.270
The Yamato has surfaced,
Commander Shultz.

00:08:10.270 --> 00:08:13.670
Fools. They came out
to commit suicide.

00:08:13.670 --> 00:08:16.760
The energy charge of the
Reflective Satellite Cannon is 120%.

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:18.040
Good.
Prepare to fire.

00:08:18.990 --> 00:08:20.250
Adjust firing angle.

00:08:20.250 --> 00:08:22.830
Satellite 3, reflective plate,
20 degrees to the right.

00:08:27.330 --> 00:08:29.740
Satellite 8,
open reflective plate.

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:32.720
The reflector has opened.

00:08:33.270 --> 00:08:34.080
Dive.

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:34.940
Diving.

00:08:39.640 --> 00:08:41.500
Fire the Reflective Satellite Cannon.

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:14.500
That was close.

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:17.620
It's useless
under the sea.

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:19.950
The origin of the
laser cannon was pinpointed.

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:22.110
It's AF3 102.

00:09:22.110 --> 00:09:23.710
Inform Kodai.

00:09:23.710 --> 00:09:24.470
Aye, sir.

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:28.140
Nanbu, fire missiles
and destroy the area.

00:09:28.140 --> 00:09:28.670
Aye, sir.

00:09:38.460 --> 00:09:40.170
Look, everyone.

00:09:41.150 --> 00:09:42.790
The Yamato's missile attack.

00:09:43.450 --> 00:09:46.640
I see, that's where the
reflector cannon is located.

00:09:48.800 --> 00:09:51.590
It's aiming at the launch site of
the Reflective Satellite Cannon.

00:09:51.590 --> 00:09:54.290
Gantz, launch the bombers.

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:58.370
Bombard them constantly, and
force the Yamato to the surface.

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:08.270
We're near the
designated coordinates.

00:10:14.700 --> 00:10:17.700
Mr. Sanada, where is
the exhaust port ?

00:10:21.730 --> 00:10:26.730
We only have three more hours.
Make them shoot the laser again.

00:10:27.990 --> 00:10:30.320
Analyzer, contact the Yamato...

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:49.700
At this rate, the damage
will only get worse.

00:10:49.700 --> 00:10:56.740
Captain, the special assault team is
asking if we can make them fire again.

00:11:00.140 --> 00:11:02.600
Alright, surface,
and let Gamilus attack.

00:11:02.600 --> 00:11:04.090
Aye, sir.
Surfacing.

00:11:04.090 --> 00:11:05.300
Blowing main tank.

00:11:16.210 --> 00:11:19.360
Here comes the Yamato.
Withdraw the attack squadron.

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:22.350
Prepare to fire the
Reflective Satellite Cannon.

00:11:22.670 --> 00:11:24.840
Bearing AP5, 39.

00:11:24.840 --> 00:11:27.410
Satellite 3,
20 degrees to the left.

00:11:33.050 --> 00:11:34.100
Fire.

00:11:41.850 --> 00:11:45.540
As I thought.  The cannon is
hidden deep under the sea.

00:11:45.540 --> 00:11:47.110
Chief Engineer Sanada, look.

00:11:51.470 --> 00:11:54.250
That's it.  That's where
the exhaust port is.

00:12:14.720 --> 00:12:16.740
The Yamato has submerged.

00:12:16.740 --> 00:12:19.650
The Yamato is acting
strangely, don't you think ?

00:12:19.650 --> 00:12:20.950
What do you mean ?

00:12:20.950 --> 00:12:23.600
It's like they're
making us fire on purpose.

00:12:24.600 --> 00:12:26.320
They might be
planning something.

00:12:33.290 --> 00:12:34.140
There they are.

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:35.270
We finally found it.

00:12:48.970 --> 00:12:49.940
Wait.

00:12:58.740 --> 00:13:00.620
They're indigenous
creatures of Pluto.

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:04.170
Don't kill them. Use a stun gun
and put them to sleep.

00:13:31.940 --> 00:13:33.020
Sugiyama !

00:13:39.930 --> 00:13:41.630
Please understand.{Don't be angry.}

00:14:02.350 --> 00:14:03.980
It's slippery,
so be careful.

00:14:07.500 --> 00:14:11.070
Let's hurry. We've got to
finish our job before they fire.

00:14:11.070 --> 00:14:14.680
Yeah, if they fire the cannon,
we'll be broiled alive.

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:20.770
Analyzer, cut a hole here.

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:22.250
Right.

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:30.480
It looks like
a generator room.

00:14:54.360 --> 00:14:55.230
It's a dead end.

00:14:56.170 --> 00:14:57.270
Let's break through.

00:15:07.030 --> 00:15:08.420
What's this room ?

00:15:09.150 --> 00:15:10.370
Wait, Kodai.

00:15:32.170 --> 00:15:35.470
Captain, the ship's
air reserves are very low.

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:38.740
This is bad.

00:15:38.740 --> 00:15:44.350
Captain, anoxia patients are increasing.
Do something. I can't handle it.

00:15:44.350 --> 00:15:45.730
Captain.

00:15:45.730 --> 00:15:49.150
Calm down.
We still have 30 minutes left.

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:01.800
You're next.
Hurry.

00:16:06.420 --> 00:16:08.210
I'll go next.

00:16:30.900 --> 00:16:32.400
There it is.
Kodai, that's it.

00:16:37.490 --> 00:16:38.380
Nemoto...

00:16:42.990 --> 00:16:45.410
Kodai, Kodai.
Kodai, please respond.

00:16:45.410 --> 00:16:46.930
Aihara, don't.
It's no use.

00:16:48.280 --> 00:16:51.730
Kodai, what happened ?
Please answer.

00:16:55.230 --> 00:16:58.530
It's time.
Start the Wave Motion engine.

00:17:04.420 --> 00:17:07.800
Kodai, don't die.
Make sure you come back.

00:17:16.540 --> 00:17:17.390
Hurry.

00:17:30.940 --> 00:17:31.620
Sugiyama...

00:17:33.340 --> 00:17:34.470
Damn you.

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:46.390
It was hidden in
a place like this.

00:17:46.390 --> 00:17:46.920
Hurry !

00:17:56.490 --> 00:17:58.380
Run !
They'll explode soon !

00:18:23.180 --> 00:18:25.750
The Yamato has
surfaced and is advancing.

00:18:25.750 --> 00:18:29.730
The energy charge of the
Reflective Satellite Cannon is 120%.

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:37.740
Satellite 2, move
5 degrees to the left.

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:39.990
Wait, Gantz.

00:18:39.990 --> 00:18:44.010
The Yamato seems to be submerging by
observing the motion of our satellites.

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:45.610
Use different ones.

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:49.660
Take advantage of
Yamato's blind spot.

00:18:49.660 --> 00:18:53.610
Use satellites 1 and 3 to
attack the Yamato from the rear.

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:55.500
Destroy the
Yamato this time.

00:18:57.290 --> 00:19:01.520
I see. Open the reflector
panels of satellites 1 and 3.

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:13.170
Fire the Reflective Satellite Cannon.

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:28.830
Stern is heavily damaged.

00:19:28.830 --> 00:19:30.620
Cannons 4 and 5
are damaged.

00:19:30.620 --> 00:19:31.900
Captain.

00:19:31.900 --> 00:19:34.970
Extend the wings.  Lift off,
and attack the Gamilus base.

00:19:46.040 --> 00:19:47.770
An explosion
detected ahead.

00:20:35.640 --> 00:20:36.770
What happened, Gantz ?

00:20:37.680 --> 00:20:39.970
The Reflective Satellite Cannon exploded !

00:20:39.970 --> 00:20:41.460
Impossible !

00:20:41.460 --> 00:20:44.870
A tidal wave is coming !  We have
to evacuate or we'll be in danger !

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:09.190
Captain, the Gamilus
fleet is retreating.

00:21:10.090 --> 00:21:12.540
The Gamilus Pluto
base is finished.

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:15.370
There'll be no more
meteor bombs hitting the Earth.

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:18.390
Our long awaited wish
has finally come true.

00:21:32.010 --> 00:21:33.450
Lord Desler...

00:21:33.450 --> 00:21:36.870
...the Pluto frontline base
has been totally destroyed.

00:21:36.870 --> 00:21:38.740
Totally destroyed ?

00:21:38.740 --> 00:21:42.990
Yes, sir. Shultz and Gantz
narrowly escaped with their fleet.

00:21:42.990 --> 00:21:47.390
Escaped ?
So, they fled from combat.

00:21:47.390 --> 00:21:49.190
That's unforgivable.

00:21:49.190 --> 00:21:50.770
They aren't allowed to
return to planet Gamilus.

00:21:50.770 --> 00:21:53.390
Tell them to fight and die.

00:21:53.390 --> 00:21:54.730
Aye, sir.

00:21:55.210 --> 00:21:57.720
I was thinking of migrating to Earth...

00:21:57.720 --> 00:22:01.600
...but I guess I have to shoot
down a little sparrow first.

00:22:01.600 --> 00:22:03.150
Yamato, huh ?

00:22:18.090 --> 00:22:19.690
Well done, everyone.

00:22:19.690 --> 00:22:23.040
We were finally victorious
in space combat...

00:22:23.040 --> 00:22:26.060
...in which the Earth
Defense Force had been defeated.

00:22:26.060 --> 00:22:29.180
We have opened the
way for our journey.

00:22:29.180 --> 00:22:32.500
Captain, let me
go congratulate Kodai.

00:22:33.390 --> 00:22:36.910
I also want to go
and say, "Good work."

00:22:56.770 --> 00:23:02.150
Live together peacefully.
This planet is yours now.

00:23:02.150 --> 00:23:05.440
Kodai, here comes our ride from
the Yamato. It must be Shima.

00:23:05.440 --> 00:23:07.740
And Mori, too.

00:23:10.290 --> 00:23:13.240
The Gamilus base which
had dominated the Earth...

00:23:13.240 --> 00:23:16.180
...as well as the planets
of the Solar System, is gone.

00:23:16.180 --> 00:23:21.550
It shed light ahead of the journey of the
Yamato, but Gamilus's plot is far reaching.

00:23:21.550 --> 00:23:23.940
Yamato, hurry to Iscandar.

00:23:23.940 --> 00:23:26.620
The people on Earth are
waiting for your return.

00:23:26.620 --> 00:23:30.190
Mankind will be extinct in 354 days.

00:23:28.500 --> 00:23:36.000
 354 days left till the destruction of Earth

00:23:30.190 --> 00:23:33.670
Mankind will be extinct in 354 days.

00:23:38.260 --> 00:23:43.510
Okita Juzo:

00:23:38.260 --> 00:23:43.510
Naya Goro

00:23:42.340 --> 00:23:50.940
Anoko ga futteita makka na scarf

00:23:43.790 --> 00:23:49.020
Mori Yuki:

00:23:43.790 --> 00:23:49.020
Asagami Yoko

00:23:49.300 --> 00:23:54.520
Kato Saburo:

00:23:49.300 --> 00:23:54.520
Yamada Shunji

00:23:50.940 --> 00:23:59.740
Dareno tame da to omotte iruka

00:23:54.910 --> 00:24:04.410
Note:
The Yamato, when sunk in the sea of
methane on Pluto, used the third bridge,
which is upside down.

00:23:54.910 --> 00:24:04.410
Shunji Yamada dubbed the voice of Saburo Kato in this episode.  It was fixed to Akira Kamiya from episode 13 and on.

00:23:59.740 --> 00:24:08.040
Dare no tame demo ii ja nai ka

00:24:04.410 --> 00:24:14.410
Note:
The indigenous creatures on Pluto were
painted with special clear blue paint and
airbrushed.  Weak point of the paint is
its unevenness, and the scratches are
noticeable, too.

00:24:08.040 --> 00:24:16.940
Minna sono ki de ireba ii

00:24:14.410 --> 00:24:20.410
Note:
The meteor bombardment from the Pluto base,
which started in 2190, ended on Oct. 19, 2199,
thanks to the Yamato.

00:24:16.940 --> 00:24:25.340
Tabidattsu otoko no mune ni wa

00:24:20.940 --> 00:24:27.540
Translation

00:24:20.940 --> 00:24:27.540
Editing

00:24:25.340 --> 00:24:32.940
Roman no kakera ga hoshii no sa

00:24:27.540 --> 00:24:35.110
Timing

00:24:27.540 --> 00:24:35.110
Song Translations

00:24:32.940 --> 00:24:36.940
La la la...

00:24:35.110 --> 00:24:43.110
A

00:24:36.940 --> 00:24:40.940
La la la...

00:24:40.940 --> 00:24:50.840
La la la, makka na scarf
